.0】\nL142: \nL143: 【72†Latest】\nL144: \nL145: Compare\nL146: \nL147: # Choose a tag to compare\nL148: \nL149: ## Sorry, something went wrong.\nL150: \nL151: Filter\nL152: \nL153: Loading [Input]\nL154: \nL155: ## Sorry, something went wrong.\nL156: ### Uh oh!\nL157: \nL158: There was an error while loading. Please reload this page.\nL159: ## No results found\nL160: \nL161: 【70†View all tags】\nL162: \nL163: 【73†Image: @abdelfattah83†avatars.githubusercontent.com】 【74†abdelfattah83】 released this 02 Mar 12:15\nL164: \nL165: 【75†v2.10.0】\nL166: \nL167: 【76†`752e63c`】\nL168: \nL169:   * New Functionality: Batch SVD\nL170: \nL171:     * magma_?gesvj_batched performs a Jacobi-based SVD on a uniform batch of relatively small matrices\nL172:   * New Functionality: Batch QR + SVD\nL173:     * magma_?gesvj_qr_batched performs a QR factorization followed by a Jacobi-based SVD on a uniform batch of relatively small matrices\nL174:     * May outperform magma_?gesvj_batched on very tall-skinny shapes\nL175:   * New Functionality: Batch UNMQR\nL176:     * magma_?unmqr_batched (complex) and magma_?ormqr_batched (real) apply the unitary/orthogonal 'Q' matrix from GEQRF to a general M-by-N matrix\nL177:     * Only applying 'Q' from the left is currently supported\nL178:   * New Functionality: Variable-size batch non-pivoting LU factorization\nL179:     * Contributed by Wajih Boukaram, Yang Liu, and Sherry Li at LBNL\nL180:     * magma_?getrf_nopiv_vbatched performs a non-pivoting LU factorization on a non-uniform batch of matrices\nL181:     * An expert interface is available (magma_?getrf_nopiv_expert_vbatched) for handling small diagonal elements below certain threshold(s) defined by the user\nL182:   * Performance improvements for batch Cholesky factorization (magma_?potrf_batched)\nL183: \nL184:   * Performance improvements for batch triangular solve (magma_?trsv_batched)\nL185:   * Support for NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs (sm_100 and sm_120)\nL186: \nL187:     * Requires CUDA-12.8 or higher\nL188:   * Build support CUDA 13 and ROCm 7\nL189: \nL190:   * [IMPORTANT] Previously-deprecated MAGMA-sparse functionality has been removed, as well as the MAGMA V1 interface.\nL191: \nL192: Assets 2\nL193: \nL194: Loading\nL195: ### Uh oh!\nL196: \nL197: There was an error while loading. Please reload this page.\nL198: \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nmagma/COPYRIGHT at master · icl-utk-edu/magma · GitHub (https://github.com/icl-utk-edu/magma/blob/master/COPYRIGHT)\nciteturn5view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://github.com/icl-utk-edu/magma/blob/master/COPYRIGHT\",\"lineno\":220}); Total lines: 267\nL80:     *       * 【42†GitHub UniverseThe event for developers, by developers — talks, workshops, and what’s next for GitHub.†githubuniverse.com】\nL81: \nL82:   * 【43†Pricing】\nL83: \nL84: Search`/`\nL85: \nL86: 【44†Sign in】\nL87: \nL88: 【45†Sign up】\nL89: \nL90: Appearance settings\nL91: \nL92: You signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. Dismiss alert\nL93: \nL94:   1. 【46†icl-utk-edu】\nL95:   2. 【47†magma】\nL96: ## Repository navigation\nL97: \nL98:   *   * 【47†Code】\nL99:   * 【48†Issues12 (12)】\nL100:   * 【49†Pull requests7 (7)】\nL101:   * 【50†Actions】\nL102:   * 【51†Projects】\nL103:   * 【52†Security and quality】\nL104:   * 【53†Insights】\nL105: \nL106: More items\nL107: \nL108: ## Files Expand file tree\nL109: \nL110: master\nL111: \nL112: ## Breadcrumbs\nL113: \nL114:   1. 【54†magma】\nL115: \nL116: /\nL117: \nL118: # COPYRIGHT\nL119: \nL120: Copy path\nL121: \nL122: [Input: Go to file]\nL123: \nL124: Blame More file actions\nL125: \nL126: Blame More file actions\nL127: \nL128: ## Latest commit\nL129: \nL130: \nL131: \nL132: ## History\nL133: \nL134: History\nL135: \nL1